			but class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quid hoc infelicitatis?</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Ad. 4, 5, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">haruspicum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Div. 2, 29 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gravior,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					40, 55 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			 al.— <i>Plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">miseriae et infelicitates,</span>”
				<i>calamities</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. Dogm. Plat. 2, p. 17, 37</span></i>
			.</div>
